Today is Sunday.
Kochi is very quiet today.
The morning weather is very pleasant.
Today is my first video call with everyone.
My family is in Mexico.
Who is in my house now?
My father, my mother, my older brother Diego, my younger sister Sofia.
And my dog, Lola!
I am very happy today.
I am waiting for that call.
Before that, I need a small sweet.
I will show it to them.
There is a bakery near my flat.
I am going outside now.
